    "notes": [
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Salary model is conglobated (minimi retributivi include paga base, contingenza, and EDR). Modeled as base_salary with fixed_allowances: [] for all levels except level 8.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Level 8 indennità di funzione per quadri (EUR 41.31/month per sourced table) is not modeled because it applies only to supervisory employees (quadri), not all level-8 workers. Base salary for level 8 reflects the contractual minimum (EUR 2,509.13 at Aug 2026), excluding the function allowance.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Level 1 receives a special wage correction from 1 January 2025 (EUR 1,502.46, up from EUR 1,315.70 at Aug 2024), separate from the standard tranche dates of Aug 2024, Aug 2025, Aug 2026. Modeled as a four-period TimeSeries for level 1 only.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Apprenticeship (apprendistato professionalizzante) is not modeled. The CCNL uses a percentage model (three thirds at 80/90/100% of the destination level) but period durations vary by destination level (36 months split 10/10/16 for levels 8-6, 36 months split differently for lower levels). This complexity exceeds the engine's apprenticeship model.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Seniority cadence is triennale (36 months) for all levels; maximum 5 scatti. Scatto amounts derived from businessonline.it article (2025) cross-checked with kitech.it current table.",
      "INFO: Workers covered: approximately 75,000 (Assocalzaturifici member companies). Agreement signed 2024-07-17; valid 2024-01-01 to 2026-12-31.",
      "INFO: INPS rates from 2026-industria.json (same sector as metalmeccanico). IRPEF 2026 brackets applied (L. 199/2025)."
    ]
  },
